OL,3,AVanessa Trump says she is cancer-free
OL,4,Asix months after revealing diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe video, posted on Friday, teases the
OL,7,Frelease of a longer YouTube video to
OL,8,Fcome on Saturday, in which Vanessa and
OL,9,FKai Trump will discuss breast cancer
OL,10,Fawareness and prevention, Kai wrote in
OL,11,Fthe caption.
OL,13,FVanessa Trump separated from Trump Jr
OL,14,Fin 2018 and announced last year that
OL,15,Fshe had begun dating US pro golfer
OL,16,FTiger Woods.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
